  "Enrolled OMES host servers: platform and OMES fleet evidence, enrollment/trust status, and heartbeat staleness. No raw enrollment key material is ever rendered — only a fingerprint.": ["Server host OMES yang terdaftar: bukti platform dan armada OMES, status pendaftaran/kepercayaan, dan kebasian heartbeat. Materi kunci pendaftaran mentah tidak pernah ditampilkan — hanya sidik jarinya."],
