  "Enter how many units of each line are returned, why, and what happens to them. Only units set to restock become sellable again.": ["Isi berapa unit tiap baris yang dikembalikan, alasannya, dan nasib barangnya. Hanya unit yang diset restok yang bisa dijual lagi."],
