  "Upload the receipt as a private file in the media library first, then enter its media object ID here.": ["Unggah struk sebagai berkas privat di pustaka media terlebih dahulu, lalu masukkan ID objek medianya di sini."],
  "Uploaded": ["Diunggah"],
